## Modules: vPager.sys
#
# WORK VERTICAL PAGER

## Colorsets
## Check .fvwm/Extension/Colorsets.sys

## Vertical Pager (3 desk with 3 pages)

DesktopName 0 Web
DesktopName 1 Email
DesktopName 2 Office
DesktopName 3 Misc

DesktopSize "1 1"  ## (columns - rows)

Module FvwmPager VdeskPager 0 3  ## (desk number - number of desks)

DestroyModuleConfig VdeskPager: *
*VdeskPager: Geometry 120x320-0+10
*VdeskPager: Rows 4  ## (page rows)
*VdeskPager: Colorset * 36
*VdeskPager: HilightColorset * 35  ## (active page background)
*VdeskPager: BalloonColorset * 10  ## (font color)
*VdeskPager: WindowColorsets 37 18  ## (inactive - active apps)
*VdeskPager: Font "xft:Sans:size=12:antialias=True"
*VdeskPager: WindowBorderWidth 1
*VdeskPager: BalloonStringFormat %c
*VdeskPager: BallonYOffset +2
*VdeskPager: Window3dBorders
*VdeskPager: UseSkipList # hides modules
*VdeskPager: MiniIcons

Style VdeskPager NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 1, BorderColorset 13, Sticky, WindowListSkip, FixedSize, !Iconifiable, NeverFocus

## Change preloaded settings
## Example
# *ControlMP: Geometry 330x32-132+10
